<entry name="pdf-converter-additional-toc-entries.rb" start="4335" lines="11">Converter override of get_entries_for_toc to add extra entries (e.g. non-section blocks) to the table of contents.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-admonition-theme-per-type.rb" start="4348" lines="16">Converter override of convert_admonition that applies theme settings per admonition type (note, tip, warning...) via save_theme.</entry>
