<entry name="pdf-converter-change-bars.rb" start="4458" lines="15">Converter override of convert_paragraph that draws a change bar in the margin next to paragraphs carrying a role.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-chapter-image.rb" start="4475" lines="12">Converter override of ink_chapter_title that places an image above or with each chapter title.</entry>
