<entry name="pdf-converter-code-float-wrapping.rb" start="4515" lines="13">Converter override enabling float wrapping for code blocks (supports_float_wrapping?, convert_code) so text can flow around a floated code block.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-code-with-wrap-indicator.rb" start="4530" lines="51">Prawn-level module overrides (render_in_front, add_fragment_to_line, wrap) plus arrange_block that draw a visual indicator where long code lines wrap.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-colophon-placement.rb" start="4583" lines="21">Converter override of ink_toc to place a colophon page before the table of contents.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-custom-chapter-title.rb" start="4606" lines="14">Converter override of ink_chapter_title to customize how chapter titles are rendered.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-custom-part-title.rb" start="4622" lines="16">Converter override of ink_part_title to customize how part titles are rendered.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-custom-thematic-break.rb" start="4640" lines="15">Converter override of convert_thematic_break that draws a custom thematic break (horizontal rule) graphic.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-custom-title-page.rb" start="4657" lines="28">Converter override of ink_title_page that lays out a custom title page from document metadata.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-image-indent.rb" start="4687" lines="11">Converter override of convert_image that indents block images.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-large-tables.rb" start="4700" lines="32">Converter override of convert_table that renders a table with page-size/page-layout attributes on its own scratch document so wide tables can use a different page size or orientation.</entry>
<entry name="pdf-converter-license-page.rb" start="4734" lines="17">Converter override of traverse that inserts a License page read from the LICENSE file after the front matter.</entry>
