<dir path="asciidoctor-pdf/docs/modules/ROOT" level="3">
<abstract>User guide: installation, conversion and CLI, PDF-specific AsciiDoc attributes, title page, TOC, page numbers, images (paths, formats, scaling, inline, background), tables (autowidth, extent), page breaking (breakable/unbreakable), autofit, roles, icons, STEM, syntax highlighting, passthrough, interdocument xrefs, PDF outline, index, importing PDF pages, optimizing, and the upgrade notes for 2.x.</abstract>
<entry name="nav.adoc" start="5699" lines="30">Navigation list of the user-guide (ROOT) module pages, showing how the user-facing topics are grouped.</entry>
</dir>
