  subtitle:
    text-transform: uppercase
|===

[#authors]
== title-page-authors

The keys in the `title-page-authors` category control the display, arrangement and style of the author information on the title page.

[cols="3,4,6a"]
|===
|Key |Value Type |Example

|<<content,content>>
